  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:370px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Electrical Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e3/Afterimage_Creation_by_Surge.JPG/revision/latest?cb=20180414140404\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Afterimage Creation by Surge\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e3/Afterimage_Creation_by_Surge.JPG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180414140404\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e3/Afterimage_Creation_by_Surge.JPG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180414140404 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e3/Afterimage_Creation_by_Surge.JPG/revision/latest?cb=20180414140404 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Afterimage Creation by Surge\" width=\"270\" height=\"144\" data-image-key=\"Afterimage_Creation_by_Surge.JPG\" data-image-name=\"Afterimage Creation by Surge.JPG\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Noriko Ashida/Surge (Marvel Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Convert electricity into other forms of energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb electricity and convert it into other types of energy</b>. Sup-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Manipulation\" title=\"Electricity Manipulation\">Electricity Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectrical_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Electric Conversion</li>\n<li>Electrostatic Conversion</li>\n<li>Electricity Conversion</li>\n<li>Lightning Conversion</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectrical_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User can absorb electrical energy and convert it to any type of energy and vice versa meaning to absorb any type of energy and turn it into one of the basic energies known as electricity.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectrical_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Accumulation\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Accumulation\">Bio-Energetic Accumulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electrochemistry_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Electrochemistry Manipulation\">Bio-Electrochemistry Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Weather_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Weather Manipulation\">Bio-Weather Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Accumulation\" title=\"Electric Accumulation\">Electric Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Concentration\" title=\"Electric Concentration\">Electric Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Energizing\" title=\"Electric Energizing\">Electric Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electric_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Electric Dynamo\">Bio-Electric Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Conversion\">Electromagnetic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Conversion\" title=\"Ionic Conversion\">Ionic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electricity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electricity\">Personal Electricity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electrochemistry\" title=\"Personal Electrochemistry\">Personal Electrochemistry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Static\" title=\"Personal Static\">Personal Static</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Capacitor\" title=\"Electric Capacitor\">Store</a> and convert electricity into other types of energy, such as:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Freezing\" title=\"Freezing\">Cold</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Generation\" title=\"Ice Generation\">Ice</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Generation\" title=\"Cosmic Generation\">Cosmic</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Generation\" title=\"Lunar Generation\">Lunar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Generation\" title=\"Solar Generation\">Solar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Generation\" title=\"Stellar Generation\">Stellar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Time_Energy_Generation\" title=\"Time Energy Generation\">Time</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Generation\" title=\"Electricity Generation\">Electricity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Generation\" title=\"Heat Generation\">Heat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Generation\" title=\"Fire Generation\">Fire</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Generation\" title=\"Gravity Generation\">Gravity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Generation\" title=\"Light Generation\">Light</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magnetism_Generation\" title=\"Magnetism Generation\">Magnetism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Generation\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Generation\">Kinetics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Generation\" title=\"Plasma Generation\">Plasma</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Generation\" title=\"Radiation Generation\">Radiation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Wave_Generation\" title=\"Sound Wave Generation\">Sound</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectrical_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric-Heat_Conversion\" title=\"Electric-Heat Conversion\">Electric-Heat Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Heating\" title=\"Electric Heating\">Electric Heating</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Lighting\" title=\"Electric Lighting\">Electric Lighting</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectrical_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May take considerable concentration to convert electricity to other forms of energy.</li>\n<li>May cause physical damage to oneself.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectrical_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Lightning Lad (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Echo Demille (<i>Heroes</i>)</li>\n<li>Sandra (<i>Los Protegidos</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Maxwell_Dillon_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Maxwell Dillon (Earth-616)\">Maxwell Dillon/Electro</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Noriko_Ashida_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Noriko Ashida (Earth-616)\">Noriko Ashida/Surge</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://the-boys.fandom.com/wiki/Starlight\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:the-boys:Starlight\">Annie January/Starlight</a> (<i>The Boys</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span